### 9.2 Observability Plan

{{#if observabilityNarrative}}
{{observabilityNarrative}}
{{else}}
- **Logs:** structured JSON; correlate via `requestId` / `traceId`.
- **Metrics:** RED method (Rate, Errors, Duration) per endpoint; USE method (Utilization, Saturation, Errors) for resources.
- **Traces:** OpenTelemetry, sampled at 10% baseline + tail-based on errors.
- **Alerts:** SLO burn-rate (1h fast / 24h slow) → on-call pager.
- **Dashboards:** per-service operational dashboard + capacity dashboard.
{{/if}}

